      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FREQUENCY (1) showed strong early pace from the wide draw and stuck on well despite missing the frame, finishing fourth over 400m Warragul in 23.26. Worth another chance. JACK'S REGRET (5) has been hard to follow lately, running fourth (24.74) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at Shepparton. Well placed here and should do much better. TINKER RAYS (7) comes off an average performance last start when seventh at this track over 390m behind Miss My Brother (22.91) in a Grade 5. Key runner on best form. TODAY'S CARLOS (2) must be respected despite an unplaced effort here most recently.",
